Bug 2087812 - Recognize existing IMAP Trash folders with namespace prefixes. r=nursoda,mkmelin

Resolve relative Trash paths using the server and canonical path conversions
before comparing them with discovered mailboxes. Refresh the Trash existence
state after the fallback LIST so an existing folder is not created again.

Add regression coverage for namespace prefixes, custom paths, subscriptions,
server directories, non-ASCII names, SPECIAL-USE flags, and missing Trash.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338704

